l:before_prepare:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"Both material task outcomes are satisfied. The separate node-restart protocol is also complete: node1 was healthy under boot ID d9f8550d-5cb3-4929-9e62-a388df86bcf6, acknowledged a scheduled restart, returned under fa080d98-d978-418d-9b1a-92c00cc12e1b, reached `running`, and retained the account and password-aging state. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["Credential redaction prevents inspection of the password value itself, though successful direct shadow predicates establish that a nonempty, unlocked password and the requested aging fields were present.","No shadow snapshot was captured between the failed OpenSSL-based attempt and its correction, so the exact transient credential state and exposure during that brief interval cannot be directly measured."]}
